.TH "PERCH-MAILBOX-LIST" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-mailbox\-list \- list mailboxes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch mailbox list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print each mailbox name, special\-use attribute, and subscription state for an account.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-account <value>
account email
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch mailbox list \-\-account you@example.com
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-mailbox\fR(1)
